sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant SSL as SSL Layer
    participant BIO as Socket BIO
    participant OS as OS Socket

    App->>SSL: SSL_connect()
    SSL->>BIO: BIO_write(ClientHello)
    BIO->>OS: send()
    OS-->>BIO: recv(ServerHello)
    BIO-->>SSL: BIO_read()
    SSL-->>App: Handshake progresses
